{"date":"2025-12-20","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_e83be0e09bf199c2bc70b8f4013bcaf4","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1766223000,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-12-17","chunk":0,"id":"m_6b4b9e99933096381e395cc8554a4725"}}},{"id":"m_771b3047fc03da96242faf1e15525e1d","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1766223037,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_c1aef6fbde9e6e469468b608b82de5d8","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1766223074,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_06b1f493430ff3a372f684200cd73711","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1766223111,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_a041bd90c6ec9840f9bdb58e6a14b7e2","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1766223148,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_0ff285dc548e746e736fb588e198e20e","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1766223185,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_1bfa3ec6fe7cde4f893c03f6ac88122c","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1766223222,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_9dbda5358e7369ac0705301b82d9e7f7","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1766223259,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_1ccf5cdd7ff56a5b9e02403dd8d2ff35","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1766223296,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_dfa66354719ec3466de6cfd13095793a","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1766223333,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_f4c89701ce675dcb6d0f975b0cea9967","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音）","timestamp":1766223370,"time":"17:36:10","type":"文本","kind":"audio","media":[{"kind":"audio","url":"chat-assets/f421a82c97894339c36adbd27d366c4d937b8d5ee1df9c80438880f36a5cea43.wav"}]},{"id":"m_7da95916c239c067a0f1175e07711d13","sender":"me","text":"好，早餐我来准备。","timestamp":1766223407,"time":"17:36:47","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_05611f151ee32e7a1439d6155d022899","sender":"her","text":"柠檬汽水还是要冰冰的。","timestamp":1766223444,"time":"17:37:24","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_918ded10969e5d3ff74a758589c54109","sender":"me","text":"我选热可可，我们一人分对方一口。","timestamp":1766223481,"time":"17:38:01","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_9ad2be104c6db9b1e3a6ba7b4a951ec6","sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","timestamp":1766223518,"time":"17:38:38","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_2f6589b0ed3c5436394782f70f19c50d","sender":"me","text":"分享一个占位链接。","timestamp":1766223555,"time":"17:39:15","type":"文本","kind":"text","link":{"url":"https://example.com/","title":"示例链接 · example.com"}},{"id":"m_ab2cc7e79e6bb7c566fefd02366a00a4","sender":"her","text":"书只看了两页，猫倒是睡了一下午。","timestamp":1766223592,"time":"17:39:52","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_132f8b81452865325751f78750a134ec","sender":"me","text":"两页也算数，慢慢看。","timestamp":1766223629,"time":"17:40:29","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_7c00632e28f56f72be4e0e2f1a391e27","sender":"her","text":"雨停了，楼下的叶子亮晶晶。","timestamp":1766223666,"time":"17:41:06","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_24b9b8bbf5450d104749059a7f613811","sender":"me","text":"穿好外套，我们下楼走走。","timestamp":1766223703,"time":"17:41:43","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_1d33421852cf6f041c4e9240e7d8ccbf","sender":"her","text":"明天不用赶路，可以绕一点远。","timestamp":1766223740,"time":"17:42:20","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_1148b310f33b06c06d2c458526564486","sender":"me","text":"听你的，顺路买一袋栗子。","timestamp":1766223777,"time":"17:42:57","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_34f16b8c4f59b6b86bcd58cb6207b478","sender":"her","text":"回家的时候记得抬头，有一弯月亮。","timestamp":1766223814,"time":"17:43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_f855c449f20a48dc193e63203817379f","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1766223851,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
